cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or its published data files, please cite it as below.
  For individual figures, cite the official source first (for example Eurostat,
  dataset tran_sf_roadus).
type: software
title: "Vision Zero Monitor: EU road safety statistics, legislation and commitments"
abstract: >-
  An open, static website and data pipelines that bring together official EU road
  safety statistics (Eurostat, CARE), EU road safety legislation (EUR-Lex metadata)
  and EU and global road safety commitments, with full provenance for every value.
  Missing values are published as null, never estimated.
authors:
